// Copy to Local.xcconfig for per-machine overrides. Debug and Release both include it last with
// #include?, so it wins over them and its absence is not an error. It is gitignored, in the same
// way and for the same reason as .env.
//
// The one thing worth setting here is the API origin for a build running on a physical phone,
// which cannot reach the Mac's loopback: use the Mac's LAN address or a tunnel. The two-slash
// dance is explained in Base.xcconfig.
//
// LH_API_BASE_URL = http:$(LH_SLASH)$(LH_SLASH)192.168.1.10:7025
//
// A device build also needs a team, which is not committed either:
// DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = ABCDE12345
